                            <div class="content-breck ">
                                <p class="description vertical-space"
                                    style="text-align: left; color: rgb(133 119 175);">
                                    <b>
                                        Tranquil Introvert
                                    </b>
                                </p>
                                <p class="description" style="font-size: 12px !important; text-align: left;">
                                    This individual is generally
                                    calm and composed, not easily
                                    swayed by emotional ups and
                                    downs.
